 CNSsolve>! protein-ss-restraints-all.def 
 CNSsolve>!    Define automatically secondary stucture dihedral angle restraints for all residues 
 CNSsolve>! 
 CNSsolve>! *********************************************************************** 
 CNSsolve>! * Copyright 2003-2018 Alexandre Bonvin, Utrecht University.           * 
